<section class="spares-section" id="repuestos">
    <div class="spares-intro">
        <div class="section-kicker dark" style="color: var(--color-yellow);" data-reveal>Soporte y Mantenimiento</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>Repuestos y Reacondicionamiento</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle" data-reveal>Aseguramos la m&aacute;xima operatividad con repuestos de nuestra l&iacute;nea RG, reacondicionamiento y soluciones compatibles verificadas por modelo.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Carousel Container -->
    <div class="spares-carousel-container" data-reveal>
        <div class="spares-carousel">
            
            <!-- Card 1 -->
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-card-image">
                    <div class="urvig-crossfade">
                        <div class="crossfade-bg" style="background-image: url('/conjunto-disco-embrague.png');"></div>
                        <div class="crossfade-bg" style="background-image: url('/stock-ejes.jpeg');"></div>
                        <div class="crossfade-bg" style="background-image: url('/stock-carcazas.jpeg');"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="product-card-content">
                    <div class="card-kicker">01. L&iacute;nea propia RG</div>
                    <h3>Repuestos L&iacute;nea RG</h3>
                    <p>Piezas RG fabricadas por ANGO bajo m&aacute;xima exigencia. Precisi&oacute;n y durabilidad para mantener su producci&oacute;n sin interrupciones.</p>
                    <div class="card-action">
                        <a href="https://wa.me/5493571699006" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline">Consultar stock</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-card-image">
                    <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="product-video-bg">
                        <source src="/video-mantenimiento.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
                    </video>
                </div>
                <div class="product-card-content">
                    <div class="card-kicker">02. Ahorro y Garant&iacute;a</div>
                    <h3>Reacondicionamiento</h3>
                    <p>No descarte su embrague desgastado. Nuestros t&eacute;cnicos expertos lo desarman, eval&uacute;an y restauran dej&aacute;ndolo con rendimiento y apariencia de 0km.</p>
                    <div class="card-action">
                        <a href="https://wa.me/5493571699006" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline">Solicitar presupuesto</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 3 (Urvig con 3 imagenes rotativas) -->
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-card-image">
                    <div class="urvig-crossfade">
                        <div class="crossfade-bg" style="background-image: url('/platoconcono_urvig.jpeg');"></div>
                        <div class="crossfade-bg" style="background-image: url('/platodesplazable_urvig.jpeg');"></div>
                        <div class="crossfade-bg" style="background-image: url('/portacollar_urvig.jpeg');"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="product-card-content">
                    <div class="card-kicker">03. Compatibilidad por modelo</div>
                    <h3>Compatibles Urvig y Micron</h3>
                    <p>Soluciones fabricadas y comercializadas por ANGO. Verificamos modelo, medidas y aplicaci&oacute;n antes de confirmar disponibilidad o fabricaci&oacute;n.</p>
                    <div class="card-action">
                        <a href="/repuestos-compatibles-urvig-micron" class="btn btn-outline">Ver compatibles</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .spares-section {
        background-color: var(--color-dark);
        color: var(--color-surface);
        padding: 100px 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    .spares-intro {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto 60px;
        padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .spares-intro .section-title {
        color: var(--color-surface);
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    
    .spares-intro .section-title:after {
        color: var(--color-yellow);
    }
    
    .spares-intro .section-subtitle {
        color: #94a3b8;
    }

    /* Carousel */
    .spares-carousel-container {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0 20px 40px;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .spares-carousel {
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
        padding-bottom: 30px; /* space for scrollbar */
        -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
        scrollbar-width: thin;
        scrollbar-color: var(--color-primary) rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }
    
    .spares-carousel::-webkit-scrollbar {
        height: 6px;
    }
    .spares-carousel::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .spares-carousel::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
        background: var(--color-primary);
        border-radius: 4px;
    }

    /* Product Card */
    .product-card {
        flex: 0 0 85vw; /* full screen minus peeking edge on mobile */
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        scroll-snap-align: center;
        box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .product-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-8px);
        box-shadow: 0 25px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .product-card {
            flex: 0 0 380px;
            scroll-snap-align: start;
        }
        .spares-carousel {
            gap: 30px;
            padding-left: calc(50vw - 600px); /* Adjust based on container */
        }
        .spares-carousel-container {
            padding-left: 0;
            padding-right: 0;
        }
    }
    
    @media (min-width: 1280px) {
        .spares-carousel {
            justify-content: center; /* Center cards perfectly on ultra-wide */
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
    }

    /* Image Area */
    .product-card-image {
        width: 100%;
        height: 260px;
        background-color: #f1f5f9; /* Soft background for product shots */
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .product-image-bg {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background-size: cover; /* Image fills the container */
        background-position: center;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        transition: transform 0.5s ease;
    }

    .product-video-bg {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        transition: transform 0.5s ease;
    }

    .product-card:hover .product-image-bg,
    .product-card:hover .product-video-bg {
        transform: scale(1.05); /* Slight zoom on hover for dynamism */
    }

    /* Urvig Crossfade */
    .urvig-crossfade {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
    }

    .crossfade-bg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background-size: cover; /* Image fills the container */
        background-position: center;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        opacity: 0;
        animation: crossfadeAnim 12s infinite;
        transition: transform 0.5s ease;
    }

    .product-card:hover .crossfade-bg {
        transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .crossfade-bg:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0s; }
    .crossfade-bg:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 4s; }
    .crossfade-bg:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 8s; }

    @keyframes crossfadeAnim {
        0% { opacity: 0; }
        8% { opacity: 1; }
        33% { opacity: 1; }
        41% { opacity: 0; }
        100% { opacity: 0; }
    }

    /* Text Area */
    .product-card-content {
        padding: 32px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        flex-grow: 1;
        background: #ffffff;
    }

    .card-kicker {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .product-card-content h3 {
        color: var(--color-dark);
        font-family: var(--font-heading);
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        line-height: 1.2;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-stretch: 75%;
    }

    .product-card-content p {
        color: #475569;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
        flex-grow: 1; /* Pushes button to bottom */
    }

    .card-action {
        margin-top: auto;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        padding-top: 12px;
    }

    .card-action .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 12px 28px;
        border-radius: 50px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 13px;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        border: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
        color: var(--color-primary);
        background: transparent;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    .card-action .btn:hover {
        background-color: var(--color-primary);
        color: #fff;
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 87, 184, 0.2);
    }
</style>
